  "claim": "When a session opens, Claude Code contacts a plugin's remote MCP server before any tool is used: a POST of initialize, with its client name, title, version, description, website and capabilities, and nothing about the folder or the code. Answered 401, it then asks the server's well-known addresses where to sign in, and the turn goes on without the server.",
