  "observed": "2026-11-02",
  "how": "node observations/claude-code/plugin-mcp-session-open.probe.mjs (beside this record). It runs one `claude -p` turn from an empty folder, with a throwaway plugin whose .mcp.json names a server on this machine that answers everything 401, and prints what reached the server. The turn calls a model.",
  "recheckWhen": "Claude Code is upgraded, or .mcp.json changes shape.",
